{"stories":{"timeline/quest_story_15214020":{"episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15214020","sequence_index":445,"plot_row_index":"6250","order_index":"6250","numeric_id":"15214020","physical_section":"timeline","sequence_source":"exploration_task_graph","plot_id":"15214020","dialogue_kind":"Normal","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","summary_source_cn":"你为加拉亲手制作了一枚守护之叶，弥补了她的遗憾。从今往后，再也没有人敢说她是被抛弃的孩子。","summary_i18n":{"cn":"你为加拉亲手制作了一枚守护之叶，弥补了她的遗憾。从今往后，再也没有人敢说她是被抛弃的孩子。","en":"You crafted a Guardian Leaf for Gala, making up for what she was denied. From now on, no one would dare call her an abandoned child again.","jp":"あなたはガーラのために守護の葉を作り、彼女の無念を晴らしてあげた。これから先、彼女を捨てられた子と呼ぶ者はなくなるだろう。","kr":"갈라를 위해 직접 수호의 잎사귀를 만들어 아쉬움을 달래주었다. 이제 다시는 누구도 갈라를 버림받은 아이라고 부르지 못할 것이다."},"summary_record_index":"exploration:15010228","summary_match_status":"exact_hash","context_summary_source_cn":"树怒山谷里，巫祭正在为神挑选新的祭品。你决定旁观一下他们是如何挑选的。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"树怒山谷里，巫祭正在为神挑选新的祭品。你决定旁观一下他们是如何挑选的。","en":"In Wrathwood Grove, the priests and priestesses are choosing a new sacrificial offering for their Herdmaster. You decide to watch how the selection is made.","jp":"樹怒の谷では、祭官が神へ捧げる新たな供物を選んでいた。あなたはその様子を見てみることにした。","kr":"분노의 골짜기의 주술 사제가 신에게 바칠 새로운 제물을 고르고 있다. 옆에서 제물 고르는 것을 지켜보기로 했다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25422,"context_summary_record_indices":[25422],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15214025","context_summary_direction":"next_numeric_summary","context_summary_distance":1,"quest_title_source_cn":"侍神之人","quest_title_i18n":{"cn":"侍神之人","en":"The Divine Servant","jp":"神に仕えし者","kr":"신을 섬기는 자"},"quest_title_status":"exact_hash","quest_title_record_index":"42919","quest_summary_i18n":{"cn":"