d again.","jp":"あなたはガーラのために守護の葉を作り、彼女の無念を晴らしてあげた。これから先、彼女を捨てられた子と呼ぶ者はなくなるだろう。","kr":"갈라를 위해 직접 수호의 잎사귀를 만들어 아쉬움을 달래주었다. 이제 다시는 누구도 갈라를 버림받은 아이라고 부르지 못할 것이다."},"summary_record_index":"exploration:15010228","summary_match_status":"exact_hash","context_summary_source_cn":"为了成为完美的信徒，加拉没有交朋友。她唯一的“朋友”是一个被她称作“阿曼”的土坡，无论有什么话，她都会对阿曼说。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"为了成为完美的信徒，加拉没有交朋友。她唯一的“朋友”是一个被她称作“阿曼”的土坡，无论有什么话，她都会对阿曼说。","en":"In her effort to be the perfect believer, Gala never made friends. Her only \"friend\" is a mound she calls Oman, in whom she confides everything.","jp":"完璧な信徒になるため、ガーラは友達も作らなかった。彼女にとって唯一「友達」と呼べるのは「アマン」と名付けた小さな丘だけであり、どんなこともそのアマンに話していた。","kr":"갈라는 완벽한 신도가 되고자 친구를 사귀지 않았다. 갈라가 무슨 말이든 할 수 있는 유일한 “친구”는 “아만”이라고 부르는 언덕이었다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25429,"context_summary_record_indices":[25429],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15214160","context_summary_direction":"next_numeric_summary","context_summary_distance":2,"quest_title_source_cn":"侍神之人","quest_title_i18n":{"cn":"侍神之人","en":"The Divine Servant","jp":"神に仕えし者","kr":"신을 섬기는 자"},"quest_title_status":"exact_hash","quest_title_record_index":"42919","quest_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你为加拉亲手制作了一枚守护之叶，弥补了她的遗憾。从今往后，再也没有人敢说她是被抛弃的孩子。","en":"You crafted a Guardian Leaf for Gala, making up for what she was denied. From now on, no one would dare call her an abandoned child again.","jp":"あなたはガーラのために守護の葉を作り、彼女の無念を晴らしてあげた。これから先、彼女を捨てられた子と呼ぶ者はなくなるだろう。","kr":"갈라를 위해 직접 수호의 잎사귀를 만들어 아쉬움을 달래주었다. 이제 다시는 누구도 갈라를 버림받은 아이라고 부르지 못할 것이다."},"quest_summary_status":"exact_hash","quest_summary_record_index":"42920","objective_title_source_cn":"寻找加拉","objective_title_i18n":{"cn":"寻找加拉","en":"Find Gala","jp":"ガーラを探す","kr":"갈라 찾기"},"objective_title_status":"exact_hash","objective_title_record_index":"53796","objective_key":"15010228:2:1","objective_task_id":"2","objective_step_id":"1","objective_summary_source_cn":"你了解到加拉是于血月降生的孩子，没有自己的守护之叶。去树怒山谷西侧的树林中寻找加拉，告诉她你会为她弥补遗憾吧。","objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你了解到加拉是于血月降生的孩子，没有自己的守护之叶。去树怒山谷西侧的树林中寻找加拉，告诉她你会为她弥补遗憾吧。","en":"You learn that Gala was born under a blood moon and has no Guardian Leaf of her own. Go to the forest west of Wrathwood Grove and tell her you'll make it right.","jp":"あなたは、ガーラがブラッドムーンの日に生まれ、守護の葉を持たないことを知った。樹怒の谷の西にある森で彼女を探し、彼女の無念を晴らしてあげよう。","kr":"갈라가 붉은 달 아래에서 태어난 아이라서 수호의 잎사귀가 없다는 사실을 알게 되었다. 분노의 골짜기 서쪽 숲에서 갈라를 찾아 아쉬움을 달래주겠다고 하자."},"objective_summary_status":"exact_hash","objective_summary_record_index":"53795","objective_prerequisite_stories":[],"exploration_line_id":"15010228","exploration_collection_key":"season_5","exploration_chapter_key":"season_5","exploration_story_kind":"side_quest","exploration_evidence_source":"ExplStep.ClientFinishActionByMove.C_RunPlot","exploration_placement_note":"","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"arc_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"cinematics":[{"node_id":"line:2:timeline::","timeline_name":"timeline_1501_0230_21.prefab","timeline_resource_name":"timeline_1501_0230_21","summary_text_key":"","summary_source_cn":"","summary_i18n":{},"summary_status":{},"summary_record_index":"","metadata_source":"","subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":3}],"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15214150","asset_path":"timeline/quest_story/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__timeline__quest_story_15214150.decoded.json","graph":"stories/timeline/quest_story/15214150.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/timeline/quest_story/15214150.json","en":"locales/en/timeline/quest_story/15214150.json","jp":"locales/jp/timeline/quest_story/15214150.json","kr":"locales/kr/timeline/quest_story/15214150.json"},"machine_locales":{},"stats":{"source_node_count":29,"graph_node_count":30,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":37